    "final_report_markdown": "# Research report\n\n比较 PostgreSQL 17 与 MySQL 8.4 的 JSON 索引与查询能力，并引用各自官方文档；在网页已归档、抽取未开始时终止 Worker，并由新 Execution 接管。\n\n**Outcome:** `COMPLETED_WITH_LIMITATIONS`\n\n## Verified findings\n\n### PostgreSQL offers two types for storing JSON data: \\`json\\` and \\`jsonb\\`.\n\n- Cell: `subject:answer`\n- Candidate: `2b2da87f-560f-4171-9bd7-d90f93e206bf`\n- Evidence: `evidence:0c206bafb2776dd4948ecaff519b013c2681712a8e05fde4`\n  - Exact quote: “PostgreSQL offers two types for storing JSON data: \\`json\\` and \\`jsonb\\`.”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/5ce66d71-1088-4890-a9a2-0bb025f68da2/001285bc3fa03c1cc60144f4b753113a31378699be9d0e3612791921deb920d8`\n  - URL: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/datatype-json.html\n\n### PostgreSQL offers two types for storing JSON data: \\`json\\` and \\`jsonb\\`.\n\n- Cell: `subject:key_evidence`\n- Candidate: `06114b09-54e5-43bd-96f5-a42686d7cca4`\n- Evidence: `evidence:c838d42e12d26e1278d744a6f9eae29c3e1c7f5b32b32d43`\n  - Exact quote: “PostgreSQL offers two types for storing JSON data: \\`json\\` and \\`jsonb\\`.”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/5ce66d71-1088-4890-a9a2-0bb025f68da2/001285bc3fa03c1cc60144f4b753113a31378699be9d0e3612791921deb920d8`\n  - URL: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/datatype-json.html\n\n## Limitations\n\n- `subject:implications`: OPTIONAL_CELL_UNRESOLVED (`GAP`)\n- `subject:limitations`: OPTIONAL_CELL_UNRESOLVED (`GAP`)\n- UNRESOLVED_CELLS_REMAIN\n\n## Completion reasons\n\n- UNRESOLVED_CELLS_REMAIN",
